    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d137">

                <pb facs="0156" n="144" sameAs="frus:frus1943v05/pg144"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">824.24/869: Telegram</note>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">The Secretary of State to the Ambassador in
                        Bolivia</hi> (<hi rendition="#italic">Boal</hi>)</head>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Washington</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1943-09-21">September 21, 1943</date>.</dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>1172. The Department’s 1168, September 20, 6 p.m. The Department and OEW are
                    reluctant to announce the amendment to Plan A without Bolivia’s participation,
                    but announcement cannot be delayed <pb facs="0157" n="145" xml:id="pg145"/>
                    beyond Thursday morning.<anchor n="49" xml:id="d137-f1"/> Please telephone by
                    Wednesday afternoon at the latest.</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Hull</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
